### =====================================================
### Conversation/saveConversationResult - Test Cases
### =====================================================
# Endpoint ANÓNIMO ([AllowAnonymous]) que recibe multipart/form-data.
# Guarda el resultado de una llamada o conversación del bot (Webi):
# crea/reutiliza la conversación por número de teléfono, sube la grabación
# (solo flowType=call) y notifica por SignalR. Sin token usa el usuario
# de sistema -1; con Bearer opcional se escopa al tenant del token.
# flowType solo acepta 'call' o 'conversation'.

### Test 1: Llamada sin grabación (flowType=call) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation/saveConversationResult
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phoneNumber"

50255551234
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callerPhoneNumber"

50255550000
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callerName"

Juan Pérez
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="flowType"

call
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callStatus"

completed
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callDuration"

300
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callStartTime"

2026-01-15T14:30:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callEndTime"

2026-01-15T14:35:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="transcriptText"

Cliente confirma la entrega para mañana por la mañana.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="comment"

Llamada de confirmación de entrega.
--WebAppBoundary--

### Test 2: Llamada con grabación adjunta (el archivo recording.mp3 debe existir junto a este .http) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation/saveConversationResult
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phoneNumber"

50255551234
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="flowType"

call
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callStatus"

completed
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callDuration"

120
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="recording"; filename="recording.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./recording.mp3
--WebAppBoundary--

### Test 3: Conversación de chat (flowType=conversation, el transcript se guarda como mensaje) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation/saveConversationResult
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phoneNumber"

50255551234
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="flowType"

conversation
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="transcriptText"

Bot: ¿Recibió su pedido? Cliente: Sí, todo en orden.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="comment"

Encuesta de satisfacción completada.
--WebAppBoundary--

### Test 4: Variante autenticada (Bearer opcional, escopa al tenant del token) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation/saveConversationResult
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phoneNumber"

50255551234
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="flowType"

conversation
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="transcriptText"

Conversación registrada con el usuario del token.
--WebAppBoundary--

### Test 5: Sin phoneNumber (campo requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation/saveConversationResult
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="flowType"

call
--WebAppBoundary--

### Test 6: flowType inválido (solo 'call' o 'conversation') → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation/saveConversationResult
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phoneNumber"

50255551234
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="flowType"

videocall
--WebAppBoundary--
